e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  musculoskeletal injury in the last three months;\n-  cardiovascular diseases;\n-  use of anabolic, anti-inflammatory and analgesic drugs 72 hours before the evaluations;\n-  use of alcohol and illicit drugs during the collection period;\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- musculoskeletal injury in the last three months;",\n              "Condition": [\n                "injury"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- cardiovascular diseases;",\n              "Condition": [\n                "diseases"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- use of anabolic,",\n              "Drug": [\n                "anabolic"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "anti-inflammatory",\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "anti-inflammatory"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "and analgesic drugs 72 hours before the evaluations;",\n                  "Drug": [\n                    "analgesic drugs"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- use of alcohol",\n          "Drug": [\n            "alcohol"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "and illicit drugs during the collection period;",\n          "Drug": [\n            "illicit drugs"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
