e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\nAdult Healthy Volunteers :\n- Over 18 years of age\nNeonates:\n-  Aged between 1h of life and 28 days of life\n-  Born beyond 33 Week of Amenorrhea + 1day and 2kg of birth weight\n-  Hospitalized in the medical-surgical centre of Pediatrics of the hospital of Strasbourg\n-  For whom a blood sample was prescribed as part of their routine care\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "Adult Healthy Volunteers :"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Over 18 years of age"\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "Neonates:"\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Aged between 1h of life and 28 days of life"\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Born beyond 33 Week of Amenorrhea + 1day and 2kg of birth weight"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Hospitalized in the medical-surgical centre of Pediatrics of the hospital of Strasbourg"\n    }\n  },\n  "right": {\n    "raw_text": "- For whom a blood sample was prescribed as part of their routine care"\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
