e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Patient with indication for epiduroscopy in the usual clinical practice\n-  Neurogenic claudication\n-  Lumbar pain for more than 6 months\n-  Numerical rating scale >6\n-  No response with medical treatment\n-  No response with other interventional treatment: epidurolysis\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patient with indication for epiduroscopy in the usual clinical practice"\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Neurogenic claudication",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Neurogenic claudication"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Lumbar pain for more than 6 months",\n                  "Condition": [\n                    "pain"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "pain"\n                  ]\n                }\n              }\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- Numerical rating scale >6",\n              "Observation": [\n                "Numerical rating scale"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- No response with medical treatment"\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- No response with other interventional treatment: epidurolysis"\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
