e included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n1. Presence of moderate to severe pain from other causes that may confound assessment or self-evaluation of NP.\n2. Subjects with both DPN and PHN\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "1. Presence of moderate to severe pain from other causes that may confound assessment or self-evaluation of NP."\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "2. Subjects with both DPN and PHN",\n      "Condition": [\n        "DPN",\n        "PHN"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
